{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","x":0.76691729489242821,"w":0.054511273701985719,"y":0.076947842688772083,"h":0.014621924371467587,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418447559619,"y":0.12354651167011554,"t":"JIM:","c":1,"x":0.082706766553677327,"w":0.028195489247639968},{"w":0.047195657094319665,"h":0.0093984972332955552,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.084484878209306724,"c":1,"y":0.1522774955259375},{"t":"JIM:","c":1,"y":0.1686046510621888,"w":0.024436090787251785,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"x":0.084586465798416721},{"x":0.084559011596398129,"w":0.045167690912882488,"h":0.0088918462386072816,"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.18305407686207886},{"y":0.21220930219836687,"h":0.011627907148116789,"w":0.028195489247639982,"c":1,"x":0.080827067318983453,"t":"JIM:"},{"c":1,"x":0.084586466282456765,"y":0.27180232549817207,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"w":0.04511278152465821,"t":"TUTOR:"},{"h":0.010174418447559619,"x":0.082706766948791741,"c":1,"t":"JIM:","y":0.28633720933847795,"w":0.026315789222717281},{"x":0.084528345784461667,"w":0.043349323272705076,"c":1,"h":0.0090710473536524949,"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.31523191816302287},{"t":"Logwood. That was quite complicated. I had to prepare the fabric so the dye would","x":0.14661655181962999,"y":0.12063953460566312,"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"w":0.57894734700520833},{"x":0.1447368456702702,"y":0.15116279088905915,"t":"I hope you were careful to wear gloves.","w":0.28195487976074218,"h":0.014645322245777859,"c":1},{"y":0.16533106548381304,"x":0.14836764566414398,"c":1,"t":"Yes. I know the danger with that dye.","w":0.26152915954589839,"h":0.014330761400408232},{"c":1,"x":0.14654900454302114,"y":0.18019700164639141,"t":"Good. It can be extremely dangerous if it's ingested. Now, presumably you had a","w":0.56590957641601569,"h":0.017929667898400448},{"w":0.4080179850260417,"t":"look at an insect-based dye? Like cochineal, for example?","h":0.014507460118261206,"c":1,"x":0.14656348700498578,"y":0.19474017862723703},{"w":0.5809343465169271,"t":"Yes. I didn't actually make that, I didn't have time to start crushing up insects to get","y":0.20927346381883793,"h":0.016358913487952043,"c":1,"x":0.14655912431279147},{"c":1,"h":0.014567641081997262,"x":0.14661654198527013,"y":0.22529069787100431,"t":"the red colour and anyway they're not available here, but I managed to get the dye","w":0.57706766764322914},{"t":"quite easily from a website. But it cost a fortune. I can see why it's generally just","y":0.23982558159113077,"w":0.56015040079752609,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.14661652877524348,"c":1},{"y":0.25434642609449865,"c":1,"x":0.14661654498956589,"w":0.28195487976074218,"t":"used in cooking, and in small quantities.","h":0.014548922536915088},{"t":"Yes, it's very effective, but that's precisely why it's not used as a dye.","y":0.26883451406035164,"c":1,"x":0.14661654324013909,"w":0.48120300292968754,"h":0.014595718285535408},{"w":0.59210525512695322,"x":0.14473684602523301,"y":0.28488372112782301,"t":"I also read about using metal oxide. Apparently you can allow iron to rust while it's in","h":0.014536755666837209,"c":1},{"t":"contact with the fabric, and that colours it.","w":0.29323308308919271,"x":0.14473684185139365,"y":0.29941860470254955,"h":0.013202129297692489,"c":1},{"t":"Yes, that works well for dying cotton. But you have to be careful as the metal can","x":0.14473685383799742,"y":0.31390856393786726,"h":0.014579807952075252,"w":0.56954884847005216,"c":1},{"h":0.014626603700695573,"t":"actually affect the fabric and so you can't expect to get a lot of wear out of fabrics","w":0.56766916910807297,"y":0.32839665190987888,"c":1,"x":0.14473684390158126},{"c":1,"w":0.53759399414062492,"y":0.34288473926708929,"t":"treated in this way. And the colours are quite subtle, not everyone likes them.","x":0.14473683737777085,"h":0.01481004507405026},{"h":0.015988372635703296,"y":0.35755813925329472,"c":1,"x":0.14473683758246986,"t":"Anyway, it looks as if you've done a lot of work...","w":0.34774436950683596},{"h":0.013333747406890195,"c":1,"y":0.18155987044102129,"t":"Q28","x":0.74615936997754018,"w":0.03399704933166503},{"c":1,"y":0.24127906964755585,"x":0.74624060195951147,"t":"Q29","h":0.011627907148116789,"w":0.031954886118571002},{"t":"Q30","x":0.74624060221797017,"y":0.3139534882656998,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733,"w":0.031954886118571002},{"c":1,"t":"SECTION 4","x":0.082706767876321835,"y":0.40552325600350614,"w":0.1372180430094401,"h":0.014631283644008675},{"w":0.63909774780273443,"h":0.014641578782395359,"t":"Last week, we started looking at reptiles, including crocodiles and snakes. Today, I'd like us to","c":1,"y":0.4330328396200066,"x":0.082706765094609974},{"c":1,"h":0.01481004507405026,"t":"have a look at another reptile - the lizard - and in particular, at some studies that have been","y":0.44752092697783397,"x":0.082706766226173345,"w":0.62969924926757814},{"c":1,"t":"done on a particular type of lizard whose Latin name is tiliqua rugosa. This is commonly known","w":0.64661651611328119,"h":0.014609757501389709,"y":0.46220930252203885,"x":0.082706779427620253},{"t":"as the sleepy lizard, because it's quite slow in its movements and spends quite a lot of its time","x":0.082706774847357237,"w":0.64097742716471351,"y":0.47674418623932147,"h":0.01456296113868405,"c":1},{"h":0.01321897611108358,"t":"dozing under rocks or lying in the sun.","c":1,"y":0.49259497731452573,"x":0.080827068033775054,"w":0.26691729227701821},{"x":0.08076524135601014,"c":1,"w":0.62982279459635415,"t":"I'll start with a general description. Sleepy lizards live in Western and South Australia, where","y":0.51281773868016212,"h":0.01653408436182624},{"t":"they're quite common. Unlike European lizards, which are mostly small, green and fast-","y":0.52778305073987519,"w":0.59974817911783851,"x":0.080767076190377193,"h":0.016408255847898956,"c":1},{"x":0.080778049783237688,"y":0.54328284861530984,"w":0.64483957926432289,"h":0.015604165317316787,"c":1,"t":"moving, sleepy lizards are brown, but what's particularly distinctive about them is the colour of"},{"w":0.62796320597330735,"h":0.016285885861821114,"t":"their tongue, which is dark blue, in contrast with the lining of their mouth which is bright pink.","y":0.55729517931272865,"x":0.080755042425779494,"c":1},{"x":0.080772148985812128,"y":0.57202632942252551,"w":0.64108993530273439,"t":"And they're much bigger than most European lizards. They have quite a varied diet, including","h":0.016669804560163315,"c":1},{"t":"insects and even small animals, but they mostly eat plants of varying kinds.","x":0.080827055334746559,"h":0.013205872761074877,"w":0.51691731770833338,"y":0.58853831322586281,"c":1},{"y":0.61043142285010366,"h":0.01456857694784286,"c":1,"t":"Even though they're quite large and powerful, with strong jaws that can crush beetles and snail","x":0.082706779443085354,"w":0.6466165161132813},{"y":0.62491951067758211,"w":0.64285715738932303,"h":0.013200257566001183,"t":"shells, they still have quite a few predators. Large birds like cassowaries were one of the main","c":1,"x":0.080827060205595505},{"y":0.63800130818282152,"c":1,"t":"ones in the past, but nowadays they're more likely to be caught and killed by snakes. Actually,","h":0.017584310066139586,"w":0.63928171793619792,"x":0.080746674787741224},{"t":"another threat to their survival isn't a predator at all, but is man-made - quite a large number of","h":0.018127670460029721,"w":0.65243291219075528,"x":0.078863625738638629,"y":0.65239075868487373,"c":1},{"y":0.66740650728550754,"x":0.078874816649756763,"w":0.48324315388997391,"c":1,"h":0.017406272028464231,"t":"sleepy lizards are killed by cars when they're trying to cross highways."},{"t":"One study carried out by Michael Freake at Flinders University investigated the methods of","x":0.080827062603368721,"w":0.62406016031901046,"h":0.016118465357262801,"y":0.69027688374887131,"c":1},{"h":0.017644826320395213,"w":0.64862889607747387,"t":"navigation of these lizards. Though they move slowly, they can travel quite long distances. And","y":0.70427548121080163,"x":0.078880132650346393,"c":1},{"x":0.078885921882539234,"w":0.65237869262695303,"c":1,"y":0.71929090570947707,"t":"he found that even if they were taken some distance away from their home territory, they could","h":0.017765880935973533},{"t":"usually find their way back home as long as they could see the sky - they didn't need any other","x":0.07888327269264854,"h":0.016266642887977745,"y":0.73443225619158992,"w":0.65615305582682293,"c":1},{"x":0.08082707039455661,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733,"t":"landmarks on the ground","y":0.75000000005001477,"w":0.17481202443440752},{"w":0.64869984944661452,"t":"Observations of these lizards in the wild have also revealed that their mating habits are quite","y":0.78479426301304744,"h":0.018178254500252233,"c":1,"x":0.078843098480097684},{"h":0.020335529054738788,"c":1,"x":0.078814490761055969,"t":"unusual. Unlike most animals, it seems that they're relatively monogamous, returning to the","y":0.79950818224953601,"w":0.6450171915690105},{"h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1,"y":0.81680618155264395,"t":"same partner year after year. And the male and female also stay together for a long time,","x":0.078947363361178122,"w":0.62406016031901035},{"c":1,"x":0.078732580013708336,"h":0.017773130825850969,"y":0.8287173221955717,"w":0.31623130798339838,"t":"both before and after the birth of their young."},{"w":0.61481201171875,"c":1,"x":0.078870153534168805,"h":0.016581695615592862,"y":0.85179088691073368,"t":"It's quite interesting to think about the possible reasons for this. It could be that it's to do"},{"y":0.86767546683617502,"h":0.014591974822153131,"t":"with protecting their young - you'd expect them to have a much better chance of survival if","x":0.078947372153034365,"w":0.63533833821614583,"c":1},{"y":0.88216355419165826,"c":1,"h":0.014638771184858568,"t":"they have both parents around. But in fact observers have noted that once the babies have","w":0.63721806844075513,"x":0.078947356540325211},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"t":"Q31","x":0.74436090271139121,"y":0.54505813955353322,"w":0.031954886118570891},{"y":0.5741279069929891,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.74436090271726518,"t":"Q32","w":0.031954886118571002,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371407532731,"x":0.74060150385511847,"y":0.80087209332158893,"c":1,"w":0.037593984603881747,"t":"Q35"},{"t":"111","x":0.78195488649619582,"y":0.91424418606516111,"w":0.033834587732950894,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1}],"h":3106}